    "purpose": "Central Nepali terminology for RatnaOS. One concept, one Nepali word. Used by scripts/check_nepali.cjs to detect banned variants.",
    "updated": "2026-11-18",
    "rules": [
      "Prefer everyday Nepali used in jewellery shops over Sanskrit-heavy formal words.",
      "Keep trade words that traders actually say (कारिगर, जर्ती, ज्याला, तोला, लाल, माशा).",
      "Never translate established units, brand names or abbreviations (BOM, CSV, PDF, VAT, PAN, GST, HSN, HUID, SKU).",
      "Amounts, weights and dates are display-formatted only; stored values never change."
    ]
  },
